    [Field] _useTouchRegionOnly -> [Tooltip("If True, hovers/clicks/touches on the local button will be ignored and only Touch Region touches will be used. Otherwise, both touches on the button and on the Touch Region will be used. This also applies to mouse hover. This setting has no effect if no Touch Region is set.")]
